      "id": "orange-juice",
      "number": "01",
      "theme": "citrus",
      "titleEn": "From Toys to Orange Juice",
      "titleZh": "从玩具摊到橙汁摊",
      "summaryEn": "From selling his own toys at home and paying Mom with Post-it ‘money,’ to running a real orange juice stand and treating his friends to popsicles.",
      "summaryZh": "从卖玩具还倒给妈妈钱，到参加真实的橙汁摊，再用赚来的钱请朋友吃冰棍。",
      "bodyEn": [
        "At Haisu’s living-room toy stand, Mom didn’t just buy a toy — she also received handmade Post-it ‘money’ paid to her by the shopkeeper himself. Later, we set up a real orange juice stand together outside our home and at the park.",
        "When he spotted his own name on the stand’s poster, he was thrilled. The first time out, he felt shy about speaking to customers; by the second time, he began stepping in to hand out cups and straws on his own. At the end, the earnings turned into popsicles shared with his friends."
      ],
      "bodyZh": [
        "在 Haisu 的玩具摊，妈妈不仅能买到玩具，还能收到他倒付的便利贴“钱”。后来，我们一起开了真的橙汁摊。",
        "他看到海报上自己的名字，特别开心。第一次他不好意思和客人说话；第二次，他开始主动递杯子和吸管。最后，赚来的钱变成了和小伙伴一起吃的冰棍。"
      ],
