    {
      "id": "big-brother",
      "number": "02",
      "theme": "sage",
      "titleEn": "Growing into a Big Brother",
      "titleZh": "慢慢学着当哥哥",
      "summaryEn": "It took him a while to adjust to sharing Mom and Dad. Now he kisses her good morning, holds her steady, and shows her how things are done. And she copies everything.",
      "summaryZh": "从适应分享爸爸妈妈的关注，到学会温柔、交换玩具，并发现自己是妹妹模仿的对象。",
      "bodyEn": [
        "Adjusting to the fact that Mom and Dad’s attention no longer belonged only to him took Haisu some time. Slowly he learned to be gentle with his sister. Now, when she reaches for a toy he is playing with, he goes to find another one and says: “Meimei, trade with me!”",
        "He has also noticed that his sister watches and copies the things he does. So when she is watching, he eats his meals and brushes his teeth with extra care, learning how to be a big brother a little more each day."
      ],
      "bodyZh": [
        "适应爸爸妈妈的关注不再只属于自己，花了 Haisu 一些时间。现在，妹妹想拿他的玩具时，他会找来另一个，说：“妹妹，trade with me!”",
        "他也发现，妹妹会学着做他做的事情。于是，在妹妹面前，他开始更认真地吃饭和刷牙，也在一点点学着当哥哥。"
      ],
      "quote": {
        "zh": "“妹妹，trade with me!”",
        "en": "“Meimei (Little sister), trade with me!”",
        "attributionEn": "Holding out a second toy when his sister reaches for the one in his hand",
        "attributionZh": "当妹妹抢他的玩具时，他找来另一个玩具和妹妹商量交换"
      },
